    "body": "Thanks for the review @davidkna! \r\n\r\nYou were right, the initial version was definitely overkill. I just pushed a refactored version. \r\n\r\nI removed the `gix` and multithreading logic entirely. The module now just relies on a standard `git status` subprocess. I tested it locally and the execution time remains exactly the same (around 0.13s).\r\n\r\nLet me know if this looks better!",
